## §0.2 Pre-Flight Checklist
  Branch check: `git status` -> verify on correct branch
  Baseline build: `npm run build` -> document PASS/FAIL
  Stripe CLI running: `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhook`
  Dev server running: `npm run dev` -> http://localhost:3000 responds
  Redis connected: Can connect to Redis instance
  Scope lock: confirm no other sprint in progress

## §0.3 Active Constraint Rules (from Research)
  CONSTRAINT-1: PaymentIntent created at address submit, NOT basket click
  CONSTRAINT-2: Compensation pattern - reserve stock FIRST, then create PaymentIntent
  CONSTRAINT-3: React 18 StrictMode - loadStripe at module scope, options in useMemo
  CONSTRAINT-4: Conditional render - only show Elements when clientSecret exists
  CONSTRAINT-5: Webhook authoritative - order creation only in webhook, not client

